Package: com.andi.carly
Name: carLy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: andi <tafilajandi@gmail.com>
Author: andi
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @ISIZE@
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0)
Conflicts: com.diffmusicplayer.carlyrics
Replaces: com.diffmusicplayer.carlyrics
Icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/@REPO@/main/assets/icon.png
Native-Depiction: https://@PAGES@/depiction.json
SileoDepiction: https://@PAGES@/depiction.json
Tag: purpose::extension
Description: Synced lyrics and a customizable Now Playing screen for CarPlay
 Time-synced lyrics on CarPlay's own Now Playing screen, beside the player or
 full screen behind a microphone button, for Spotify, Apple Music and other
 audio apps.
 .
 Spotify songs get Spotify's own lyrics, fetched by the Spotify app with your
 account. Apple Music songs get Apple's, fetched by the Music app. Everything
 else comes from LRCLIB, a free community database, or lyrics saved in your own
 song files. No API keys, no accounts to add, no telemetry.
 .
 Every layout choice is in Settings with a live preview: side by side, a player
 without artwork, the lyrics on either side, fonts, colours and timing.
